ns a healthy Sharpe of 0.84 under strict conditions and remains profitable well beyond the requested 8 bps cost (EX-4), refuting the claim of substantial overfitting."}},{"t":1794815732.4780033,"role":"judge","kind":"verdict","data":{"ruling":"paper","findings":[{"sin":"other","sustained":true,"exhibits":["EX-1"],"struck":false}],"capital_allowed":0.0,"opinion":"The strategy shows significant performance degradation in the holdout period (EX-1), with the Sharpe ratio dropping from 1.72 to 0.84. While the signal appears robust in placebo and point-in-time tests (EX-2, EX-3), the substantial gap between research and live-simulated performance suggests the strategy is sensitive to execution conditions or overfitted to the training sample. Given the performance decay, I am restricting this to paper trading to verify if the strategy can maintain its edge under real-world conditions before committing capital.","unsupported":false,"defaulted":false}}],"calls":8,"tokens_in":12924,"tokens_out":454,"seconds":634.575}